{
  "harness": 1,
  "name": "3815-ui-share",
  "about": "ju-share (ui 1.3): two mod rows on two pause-layer screens join the game's own menu focus beside the pause menu's buttons (share_rows): row 1 at 0,-122 between the lower button (0,-73) and Settings (0,-161), row 2 at 0,-215. Up from nothing reaches the upper button (Back), Down the lower one, Down again row 1 (shared_focus 1, ui.share.3, row 1's pane, focused), A takes row 1 (chosen 1, once), Up gives the highlight back to the lower button (focused 0), Up to Back, and A on Back closes the menu as the game does (the pad stays the game's). Row 2 is never highlighted. Refusals: null rows with a count, 33 rows, a handle never given, a null out. After the menu's end both screens close and shared_focus answers none",
  "proves": [
    "ui.share"
  ],
  "mods": [
